# Yungu Classroom / Learning Brief — Git Ignore Rules
# ==========================================
# 凭据、生成的简报、日志和私人学习数据保存在 Git 之外。

# ============================================================
# DATA DIRECTORY (all git-ignored via wildcard)
# ============================================================
data/

# But NOT skill source files:
#   skills/learning-brief/    ← These ARE committed (skill code only)
#   src/yungu_client.py       ← API client code is committed

# ============================================================
# SPECIFIC EXCLUSIONS
# ============================================================

# Credentials
data/.yungu.env
*.env
!README.md

# Generated briefs (JSON & HTML)
data/morning/*.json
data/morning/*.html
data/evening/*.json
data/evening/*.html
data/logs/*.log
data/logs/*.txt

# Browser automation data
data/browser_cookies*

# Cache files
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Temporary exports
/tmp/yungu_*.json
/tmp/yungu_*.html
/tmp/yungu_api_exploration.json
